.DS_Store

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# veri run state (per-issue leaf logs, prompts) is ignored — EXCEPT the committed
# ledger (.tdd/issue-<n>.md), which is the source of truth for which steps are done.
# The blind-spec scratch (.tdd/issue-<n>-spec.md) is run state, so it is re-ignored
# (last match wins): the ledger is tracked, the spec is not.
.tdd/*
!.tdd/issue-*.md
.tdd/issue-*-spec.md

# the Go build of the ported scripts (skills/tdd/scripts/go): built by the shims on first
# call, or by `make go-build`; never committed
skills/tdd/scripts/go/bin/
